			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with Mountain and Cocoon changes\n\nRoutine submodule synchronization bringing in latest changes across the application stack:\n\n1. Mountain:\n   - Revert binary/lib/tauri config naming from 'Mountain' back to verbose development identifier for build continuity\n   - Implement SCM provider registration handlers: RegisterScmProvider and RegisterScmResourceGroup notifications that wire through the SourceControlManagementProvider trait\n   - Add WalkUpToProjectRoot to CliParse that walks up from build dirs to find project markers\n   - Trust Sky/Target, Output/Target, and Dependency paths in PathSecurity for bundled extensions\n   - Add benign ENOENT substrings for gitlens, copilot, claude-code, roo-cline, vim registers, and bundled product.json probes\n\n2. Cocoon:\n   - Submodule sync to latest extension host changes\n\nImpact: Mountain now properly registers SCM providers for the source control viewlet. The verbose naming revert maintains continuity with existing build artifacts and CI configurations. Extension host updated to latest.",
